'''Don't Mess With Me!''' (なめんなよ！, ''Namennayo！'', '''Don't Underestimate Me!''') is a 1-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]].

==Effect==
Worker Cat Start Level UP (M): Worker Cat's initial level starts with +2.

